{"candidateAnswer":"Volunteering at a community food bank, sorting and distributing groceries to families in need.","evidence":"[D3:5 | 8:30 pm on 1 January, 2023] John: We held some events and got to meet some people. We went to a homeless shelter to give out food and supplies. Seeing the smiles on their faces, we knew we made a real difference. We also organized a toy drive for kids in need. It was amazing seeing the community come together to spread some joy.\n[D2:1 | 6:10 pm on 22 December, 2022] Maria: Hey John, been a few days since we chatted. In the meantime, I donated my old car to a homeless shelter I volunteer at yesterday. How's the campaign going? I'm keen to hearabout it.","itemId":"urn:uuid:9149d606-8d5f-57ca-b651-50d9e5796839","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:4ef066bc8c181419532f1a5b49b98c6526db037c80f00764db1434531db921bb","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What type of volunteering have John and Maria both done?","referenceAnswer":"Volunteering at a homeless shelter","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"4ef066bc8c181419532f1a5b49b98c6526db037c80f00764db1434531db921bb"}}]}